  "name": "Sanctified Bolt",
  "line": "Paladin",
  "description": "The paladin pulls a point of holy light into an open hand, a small sigil flaring under their feet, then hurls it: a white-gold bolt with a long radiant tail streaks to the target and bursts in a cross of light, a halo ring and a fountain of golden motes, leaving a glowing sigil branded on the ground.",
