    "reads": {
      "front": "From over the caster's shoulder the light swells in the hand, then the bolt shoots away down the middle of the frame and blooms as a starburst on the target.",
      "side": "The clearest read of the flight: a bright head with a long golden tail crossing the frame in a shallow arc, then a halo ring standing up at the target and motes rising.",
      "top": "A small sigil flares under the caster, the bolt draws a straight bright line to the target, and a ring of light spreads over a glowing branded sigil.",
      "three_quarter": "Hero view. The gather, the streaking tail and the starburst all read, and the branded sigil sits as an ellipse under the target."
